  <!-- Icon geometries, sourced from Assets/svg/*-black.svg / *-white.svg. Those files are shipped
       in pairs with otherwise-identical path data - only the fill color differs, one per theme -
       so the geometry lives here once; Path.buttonIcon (Styles/Buttons.axaml) supplies color by
       inheriting the containing Button's Foreground, which already resolves to TextPrimaryBrush
       (dark in Light, light in Dark) the same way the OS-glyph icons these replace used to. -->

